@Bettina Kroll I can't set up a recurring Monday 08:00 post. I have no scheduling tool in this workspace, so I can't commit to posting the "Coastal week ahead" digest automatically from next Monday (19 Oct).

What I can do: when you ask me on a Monday, I'll post the digest here, covering #coastal-team and #coastal-random (both have the same members, so nothing crosses audiences). Open customer items will leave out money terms (rates, prices, contract values) unless Anselm or June approves them, so the digest will say "see deal desk" for those.

For a true automatic schedule, someone with access to the scheduler will need to set it up.
